.TH std::barrier::~barrier 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::barrier::~barrier \- std::barrier::~barrier

.SH Synopsis
~barrier();  \fI(since C++20)\fP

Destroys the barrier.

.SH Notes

It is only safe to invoke the destructor if all threads have been notified. The programmer
must ensure that no threads attempt to wait on *this once the destructor has been started.
The destructor does not notify and release any waiting threads.
